    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  走吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "走吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_015_lmg\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"近卫局成员\"]  可我们并不熟这里的构造，我害怕......感染者会针对我们行动。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "近卫局成员",
        "content": "可我们并不熟这里的构造，我害怕......感染者会针对我们行动。"
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_015_lmg\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  放心，我很熟悉这里。听我的指挥。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "放心，我很熟悉这里。听我的指挥。"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_015_lmg\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"近卫局成员\"]  Yes sir！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "近卫局成员",
        "content": "Yes sir！"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"近卫局成员\"]  陈sir，有个不太好的消息。根据各处的通报，整合运动的行动又变得有条理了起来，就像重新找到了指挥官一样！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "近卫局成员",
        "content": "陈sir，有个不太好的消息。根据各处的通报，整合运动的行动又变得有条理了起来，就像重新找到了指挥官一样！"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"近卫局成员\"]  他们......他们还调整了既有频道，重置了加密，我们没法再追踪他们的通讯了！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "近卫局成员",
        "content": "他们......他们还调整了既有频道，重置了加密，我们没法再追踪他们的通讯了！"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"char_015_lmg\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  ......难道他们和贫民区里的队伍汇合了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "......难道他们和贫民区里的队伍汇合了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  不可能，我已经收到消息说罗德岛处理好了贫民区里的事情，这才让我们得以不被里外夹击。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "不可能，我已经收到消息说罗德岛处理好了贫民区里的事情，这才让我们得以不被里外夹击。"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  奇怪......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "奇怪......"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_308_swire_1#5\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  阿陈，我准备——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "阿陈，我准备——"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[playsound(key=\"$d_gen_transmissionget\", volume=0.4)]",
        "type": "play_sound",
        "key": "audio/sound_beta_2/avg/d_gen_transmissionget.mp3",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_308_swire_1#5\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  通讯？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "通讯？"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  “小姐”，麻烦你去那边等我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "“小姐”，麻烦你去那边等我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_308_swire_1#5\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  你怎么每次时间都卡这么准非要在我有事找你的时候有事？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "你怎么每次时间都卡这么准非要在我有事找你的时候有事？"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  线人连上了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "线人连上了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_308_swire_1#5\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你快去。下次给你买鳞鱼蛋吃。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你快去。下次给你买鳞鱼蛋吃。"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_308_swire_1#6\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  你当我小孩吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "你当我小孩吗？"
    },
